abstract: "Reusable SPECTER2 embeddings for 146,319 papers within a 150,060-record PubMed-indexed biomaterials collection, with bibliographic metadata, original-space neighbors, fixed 2D and 3D coordinates, and topic assignments. Corpus cutoff: 2026-10-22."
